      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i checked the core router and it looks like the CPU spikes are coinciding with the jitter. i'm also seeing some CRC errors on the physical interface of edge-rt-lyon-02. could this be a bad SFP or maybe just some bad cabling causing the disruption?",
